window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After spending years of his life in prison for a crime he didn’t commit, Nevin Walsh doesn’t know where he fits in anymore.</p> <p>But then, his brother’s best friend, Luna Gallo, makes it her personal mission to help him settle back into his newfound freedom. He should say no. Turn her away. But there’s something about the woman who radiates sunshine that makes her impossible to ignore. And the harder he pushes her away, the harder she comes.</p> <p>And what starts off as an unwanted friendship turns into something he never expects. But can Nevin let go of the hurt from his past to allow himself happiness in his future?</p> <p><i>Scorch is the 10 full-length standalone novel in the Men of Inked Heatwave series by Wall Street Journal and USA Today best-selling author Chelle Bliss.</i></p> <p><b>Men of Inked®: Heatwave series:</b></p> <ul> <li>Book 1 - <i>Flame</i></li> <li>Book 2 - <i>Burn</i></li> <li>Book 3 - <i>Wildfire</i></li> <li>Book 4 - <i>Blaze</i></li> <li>Book 5 - <i>Ignite</i></li> <li>Book 6 - <i>Spark</i></li> <li>Book 7 - <i>Ember</i></li> <li>Book 8 - <i>Singe</i></li> <li>Book 9 - <i>Ashes</i></li> <li>Book 10 - <i>Scorch</i></li> <li>Book 11 - <i>Torch</i></li> </ul>"; 
